# Conformance probe pack for `until:63 chars:ais6` (spec 0.22): the
# terminator is the code of `?`. Nothing is removed: neither the padding `@`
# nor trailing spaces (ruling 7). Public. No kinds. Most significant bit first.
#
#   label  6-bit characters up to the code 63
format     conformance-long-until-ais6
version    0.22.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
field   probe.label  until:63  chars:ais6
